i32::gcdcom
s33:s15,s18,i32:syl2anc |- ( ( R e. NN /\ ( D e. NN /\ M e. NN ) ) -> ( ( R gcd D ) gcd ( prod_ w e. { u e. Prime | ( u || R /\ -. u || D ) } w gcd M ) ) = ( ( prod_ w e. { u e. Prime | ( u || R /\ -. u || D ) } w gcd M ) gcd ( R gcd D ) ) )
qed:s33,s31:eqtrd |- ( ( R e. NN /\ ( D e. NN /\ M e. NN ) ) -> ( ( R gcd D ) gcd ( prod_ w e. { u e. Prime | ( u || R /\ -. u || D ) } w gcd M ) ) = 1 )
